  "wellbeingScienceBadge": "WHO",
  "wellbeingScienceQuick": "Five statements about the last two weeks. It measures well-being, not illness: it's one of the most widely used scales in the world and free to use.",
  "wellbeingScienceHow": "Each answer scores 0 to 5; the total times 4 gives a score from 0 to 100. A change of 10 points or more is a real change. Below 50 it's usually worth looking after yourself a bit more; below 29 it's recommended to talk to a professional.",
  "wellbeingScienceAdvice": "Answer it every two weeks in the Sunday review. If you ever think about harming yourself, call now: your local emergency number, or in Colombia line 192, option 4.",
