  "bodyCatReferenciaGeneralAdultaMujer18": "General adult reference (female): 18% – 28% healthy/athletic.",
  "bodyCatDerivadaDeLaImpedanciaBioelectrica": "Derived from bioelectrical impedance ({impedanceOhms} Ω), height, weight and age.",
  "bodyCatEstimadaMedianteEcuacionAntropometricaDe": "Estimated with the Deurenberg anthropometric equation, as no BIA reading is available.",
  "bodyCatCombinaLaBioimpedanciaConLos": "Combines bioimpedance with waist and neck measurements (US Navy equation). Ideal every 14 days because it corrects for hydration changes and spots real body recomposition.",
  "bodyCatUsalaCada2SemanasEn": "Use it every 2 weeks before eating to confirm that a loss or gain comes from real tissue and not just water.",
