  "privacyTitle": "Privacy",
  "privacyTodoSeQuedaEnTu": "Everything stays on your phone",
  "privacyNbSelfcareNoTieneCuentas": "NB SelfCare has no accounts, servers or analytics. Your data lives in a single SQLite file inside the app and only leaves if you export a backup.",
  "privacyQueLeemosDeHealthConnect": "What we read from Health Connect",
  "privacyPasosSuenoConSusFases": "Steps, sleep (with its stages and wake-up time), resting heart rate, weight, body fat and hydration. We use them for your daily summary, the recovery index, sleep regularity, the coin multiplier for good rest and the patterns on your profile. If you tick a blood pressure monitor, glucose meter, pulse oximeter or thermometer under \"Your devices\", we also read that measurement (and only that) to show it in Care and in your report.",
  "privacyQueEscribimosEnHealthConnect": "What we write to Health Connect",
  "privacyLosPesajesDeTuBascula": "Your scale weigh-ins, the body fat measured by bioimpedance, the glasses of water you log and your guided breathing sessions, so other health apps you choose can see them.",
  "privacyLecturaEnSegundoPlano": "Background reading",
  "privacySoloSiActivasPausasActivas": "Only if you turn on \"Active breaks\": every 15 minutes, on the device, your steps from the last hour are checked to nudge you to move.",
  "privacyCamaraYMicrofono": "Camera and microphone",
  "privacyElEscanerDeCodigosDe": "The barcode scanner runs on your phone with an open source reader: the camera image is not stored and never leaves it. Meal dictation only turns on if your phone offers offline speech recognition.",
  "privacyLasDosUnicasSalidasA": "The only two connections to the internet",
  "privacyAlEscanearUnCodigoQue": "When you scan a code that isn't in your catalogue, or tap \"Search on Open Food Facts\", that public database is queried; the query includes none of your data and the result is saved on your phone. When you tap \"Check for updates\", the GitHub releases page is queried. There is no other connection.",
  "privacyMedicamentosYAvisos": "Medicines and reminders",
  "privacyTusMedicamentosSintomasSignosVitales": "Your medicines, symptoms, vital signs and check-ups stay on your phone. Dose reminders are discreet: they don't show the medicine's name, and the lock screen only shows that you have a reminder.",
  "privacyTuDecides": "You decide",
  "privacyPuedesRetirarCualquierPermisoDesde": "You can withdraw any permission from Health Connect or Android settings at any time. NB SelfCare keeps working with manual logging.",
